flowchart TD
    I[Request + context + history + catalog] --> P[Planner: select tool set once]
    P --> S[Lock selected set]
    S --> C1[Caller step 1: tool + arguments + values]
    C1 --> E1[env.validate then env.call]
    E1 -->|success| C2[Caller next step uses prior env results]
    C2 --> E2[env.validate then env.call]
    E2 --> N[Continue forward until done or ask]
    E1 -->|error| X[Stop sample]
    E2 -->|error| X
